namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamUIImageBrush:CornerRadius {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIImageBrush.h#DreamUIImageBrush:CornerRadius
    src   "RoundedBox only: corner radius in pixels, X top-left, Y top-right, Z bottom-right, W\nbottom-left -- clockwise from the top left, the order CSS and UDreamRectBlock both use. Each is\nclamped to half the shorter side, so a big enough radius gives a capsule rather than an error."
    text  "仅限RoundedBox：圆角半径，单位为像素，X为左上角、Y为右上角、Z为右下角、W\n为左下角——从左上角起顺时针，与CSS和UDreamRectBlock采用的顺序相同。每个值\n都会钳制到较短边的一半，因此半径足够大时会得到胶囊形，而不是报错。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIImageBrush:CornerSegments {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIImageBrush.h#DreamUIImageBrush:CornerSegments
    src   "RoundedBox only: points along each corner arc. More is smoother and costs two triangles each."
    text  "仅限 RoundedBox：每个圆角弧线上的点数。点数越多越平滑，每个点消耗两个三角形。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIImageBrush:FillAmount {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIImageBrush.h#DreamUIImageBrush:FillAmount
    src   "Filled only: how much of the image is shown, 0 shows none of it and 1 all of it."
    text  "仅限 Filled：图像显示的比例，0 表示完全不显示，1 表示全部显示。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIImageBrush:FillDirectionFlip {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIImageBrush.h#DreamUIImageBrush:FillDirectionFlip
    src   "Filled only: fill from the other end."
    text  "仅限 Filled：从另一端开始填充。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIImageBrush:FillMethod {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIImageBrush.h#DreamUIImageBrush:FillMethod
    src   "Filled only: the shape of the cut."
    text  "仅限 Filled：切口的形状。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIImageBrush:FillOrigin {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIImageBrush.h#DreamUIImageBrush:FillOrigin
    src   "Filled only: which corner or edge a radial fill starts from. Held as a byte for the same reason\nUDreamSprite holds it as one: which enum it means depends on FillMethod\n(EDreamUISpriteFillOriginType_Radial90 / _Radial180 / _Radial360), and only one of them applies\nat a time. Ignored by the horizontal and vertical methods."
    text  "仅限 Filled：径向填充从哪个角或边开始。之所以用字节保存，原因与\nUDreamSprite 用字节保存相同：它代表哪个枚举取决于 FillMethod\n（EDreamUISpriteFillOriginType_Radial90 / _Radial180 / _Radial360），同一时间只有一个适用。\n水平和垂直方式会忽略它。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIImageBrush:Margin {
