EDreamUIImageBrushDrawType.Filled {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIImageBrush.h#EDreamUIImageBrushDrawType:Filled
    src   "Show only part of the image and leave the rest transparent, the way a progress bar does.\nFillAmount is how much (0..1), FillMethod is the shape of the cut and FillOrigin which end it\nstarts from. The same geometry the sprite element fills with, so the two agree."
    text  "只显示图像的一部分，其余部分保持透明，就像进度条那样。\nFillAmount是填充量（0..1），FillMethod是切口的形状，FillOrigin是起始的一端。\n与Sprite元素填充所用的几何体相同，因此两者一致。"
    state machine
}

