    src   "Draw an image; margin is ignored"
    // from the engine's zh-Hans
    text  "绘制一张图像，无视边距"
    state draft
}

EDreamUIImageBrushDrawType.RoundedBox {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIImageBrush.h#EDreamUIImageBrushDrawType:RoundedBox
    src   "Draw the image inside a rounded rectangle, with a radius per corner (CornerRadius) and\nCornerSegments points along each arc.\n\nThis is an OUTLINE, cut out of geometry: the corners are tessellated rather than evaluated in a\nshader, so they are as smooth as the segment count and they do not antialias themselves. Where\nan exact, resolution-independent rounded rect is wanted -- with a border, gradients or shadows\n-- UDreamRectBlock does the same shape as a signed distance field in the material and is the\nbetter tool; this exists so a brush can round its corners without changing element type."
    text  "在圆角矩形内绘制图像，每个角可设置半径（CornerRadius），每条弧由\nCornerSegments个点构成。\n\n这是一个由几何体裁出的轮廓：圆角经过细分而非在\n着色器中求值，因此平滑程度取决于段数，且不会自行抗锯齿。在需要\n精确、与分辨率无关的圆角矩形时（带边框、渐变或阴影），\nUDreamRectBlock在材质中以有符号距离场生成同样的形状，是更合适的工具；\n此项的存在是为了让笔刷在不改变元素类型的前提下实现圆角。"
    state machine
}

EDreamUIImageBrushDrawType.Tiled {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIImageBrush.h#EDreamUIImageBrushDrawType:Tiled
    src   "Repeat the image at its own size across the rect, instead of stretching one copy over it.\nThe tile is the sprite's authored size, or Brush.ImageSize when the resource is not a sprite."
    text  "按图像自身尺寸在整个矩形上重复平铺，而不是把单份副本拉伸覆盖整个矩形。\n平铺单元是Sprite的原始尺寸；当资源不是Sprite时，取自笔刷的Brush.ImageSize。"
    state machine
}

EDreamUIImageBrushFillMethod {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIImageBrush.h#EDreamUIImageBrushFillMethod
    src   "How a Filled brush cuts its image. Mirrors EDreamUISpriteFillMethod value for value."
    text  "说明填充笔刷如何裁剪图像。与 EDreamUISpriteFillMethod 的值对应。"
    state machine
}

